cabal-version:      2.4
name:               terminal-size
version:            0.3.4
synopsis:           wasm32-wasi stand-in for terminal-size
description:
  The real terminal-size asks the operating system for the window dimensions
  with the TIOCGWINSZ ioctl. wasi-libc has neither that ioctl nor struct
  winsize, so the package fails to compile for wasm32-wasi.
  .
  This replacement keeps the same API and answers "no terminal attached", which
  is not a stub but the truthful answer both in a browser and under a wasm
  runtime with no tty. Substituting it here means hledger's own sources stay
  untouched.
-- Written here, but licensed as the package it stands in for, so that swapping
-- one for the other changes nothing for whoever redistributes the result.
license:            MIT
license-file:       LICENSE
copyright:          hledger-pwa contributors
build-type:         Simple

library
  exposed-modules:  System.Console.Terminal.Size
  hs-source-dirs:   src
  build-depends:    base, unix
  default-language: Haskell2010
  ghc-options:      -Wall
